    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "el0422_4137",
      "x": 87.0,
      "y": 77.0,
      "width": 216.0,
      "height": 286,
      "text": "Fixed Amount\n\n• Bet a constant amount every time\n• E.g., always bet $10\n\n$1,000 → $990 → $980\n→ ... → $0\n\n[!] Wealth is finite, so ruin is possible\n[!] Martingale is a fixed-amount strategy\n\nResult: Ruin (time bomb) [!!]",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#dc2626",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 877397,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "baseline": 16,
      "originalText": "Fixed Amount\n\n• Bet a constant amount every time\n• E.g., always bet $10\n\n$1,000 → $990 → $980\n→ ... → $0\n\n[!] Wealth is finite, so ruin is possible\n[!] Martingale is a fixed-amount strategy\n\nResult: Ruin (time bomb) [!!]"
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "el0423_8553",
      "x": 410,
      "y": 70,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 300,
      "strokeColor": "#16a34a",
