    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "el0424_8806",
      "x": 452.1,
      "y": 77.0,
      "width": 225.79999999999998,
      "height": 286,
      "text": "Proportional\n\n• Bet a constant fraction of current wealth\n• E.g., always bet 20% of assets\n\n$1,000 → $800 → $640\n→ $512 → ...\n\n[OK] Always something left → no ruin\n[OK] Exponential growth\n\nResult: Survival + compounding",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#16a34a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 543559,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "baseline": 16,
      "originalText": "Proportional\n\n• Bet a constant fraction of current wealth\n• E.g., always bet 20% of assets\n\n$1,000 → $800 → $640\n→ $512 → ...\n\n[OK] Always something left → no ruin\n[OK] Exponential growth\n\nResult: Survival + compounding"
    },
